Z||000001||MoneypitGT||07-11-2001||06:24 PM||||One thing you DON'T want to use is a regular chip from hypertech or ADS, they give you a more aggressive timing advance which will lead to detonation and a blown motor, bad. The best place I have found is <A HREF="http://www.superchips.com," TARGET=_blank>www.superchips.com,</A>  they can make a custom prom to your exact specs.  <BR>   Chris<P>------------------<BR><B>Check out my site at:</B>   <A HREF="http://www.customdynamix.com" TARGET=_blank>www.customdynamix.com</A> <BR>2 '87 GT Projects||||reg||4
